<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nu Skin near-term raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nu Skin near-term raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Nu Skin Asia Pacific Inc's near-term rating to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it kept Nu Skin's long-term rating at a buy.</p>
</text>
